sequenceDiagram

participant Toolstack
participant Xen
participant Memory as NUMA node memory

Toolstack->>Xen: XEN_DOMCTL_createdomain
Toolstack->>Xen: XEN_DOMCTL_max_mem(max_pages)

Toolstack->>Xen: XEN_DOMCTL_set_memory_claims(claims)
Xen->>Memory: Validate node and host capacity
Xen-->>Toolstack: Claim granted

Toolstack->>Xen: XEN_DOMCTL_set_nodeaffinity(node)

loop Populate domain memory
    Toolstack->>Xen: XENMEM_populate_physmap(mem_flags: physical node)
    Xen->>Memory: Allocate using the requested node policy
    Note over Xen,Memory: Non-exact requests may fall back to another node
end

Toolstack->>Xen: XEN_DOMCTL_set_memory_claims(empty)
Xen-->>Toolstack: Remaining claims released
Note over Toolstack,Xen: Any claims still outstanding are released when domain creation finishes
